{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using pca_n2000 RNA encoder, ImageNet ViT-L image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6352 is lower than the ViT-L with scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_009, 0.7062), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of RNA encoding strategies versus other factors like aggregation or fusion, as no direct comparison to alternative RNA encoder configurations was conducted."
}

